<title>FRANCE: HAVAS H1 TURNOVER UP 33 PERCENT VS H1 96.</title>
<headline>HAVAS H1 TURNOVER UP 33 PERCENT VS H1 96.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				 31,627  vs  23,781</p>
<p>Turnover by sector:</p>
<p>     Audiovisual			    14,917  vs   7,717</p>
<p>     Information/Publishing		5,038  vs   4,991</p>
<p>     Local Media			     5,429  vs   5,479</p>
<p>     Travel and Leisure		    6,243  vs   5,594</p>
<p>NOTE - Media and communications group Havas released the results in a statement and said consolidated revenues only included fully-consolidated comapnies and not companies such as Havas Advertising.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
